# CNG Station Management System — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in values from THIS PROJECT's own dashboards.
# NEVER copy values from another project (see the isolation rule in CLAUDE.md).
# `.env.local` is git-ignored and must never be committed.
#
# Only VITE_-prefixed variables are exposed to the browser bundle. Server-side
# secrets (service-role key, Clerk secret key, Resend key, VAPID private key,
# webhook secrets) are configured as Supabase Edge Function secrets and must
# NOT be added here with real values.

# --- Clerk (Application: "CNG Station Management") ---
VITE_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Supabase (Project: "cng-station-management", in its own organization) ---
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=

# --- Web Push (this project's own VAPID key pair) ---
# Public key only. The private key is an Edge Function secret.
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=

# --- App ---
VITE_APP_NAME=CNG Station Management
